Now we need to get candidate_loading_verified shift_candidate_beta. That can be achieved via verify_loading_profile_nominal or verify_loading_profile_destination_flag. Both require candidate_staged_for_loading, candidate_skill_certificate_linked, candidate_operator_linked, candidate_loading_container_linked, loading_container_leg_linked, and either not destination_leg_loaded (for nominal) or destination_leg_loaded (for destination flag). Since we will not have destination_leg_loaded (we are not assembling loaded leg), we can use verify_loading_profile_nominal which requires not destination_leg_loaded. So we need to ensure destination_leg_loaded is false. That's fine.

